OL,3,GNEWSARicky Hatton statue planned for
OL,4,Aboxer's hometown
OL,5,
OL,6,FA statue will be created in memory of
OL,7,Fboxing legend Ricky Hatton in his
OL,8,Fhometown.
OL,10,FThe former world champion died at his
OL,11,Fhome in Hyde, Greater Manchester, on 14
OL,12,FSeptember 2025, at the age of 46.
OL,14,FFollowing his death, more than 9,000
OL,15,Fpeople signed an online petition
OL,16,Fcalling for a statue in his honour.
OL,18,FCouncillors have unanimously approved a
OL,19,Fmotion backing the proposal, committing
OL,20,FTameside Council to the project, the
OL,21,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service said.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
